---
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-cta">
      <div class="cta-gears" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="fg fg-l" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <use href="#gear-shape"/>
        </svg>
        <svg class="fg fg-r" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <use href="#gear-shape"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h2 class="cta-heading">金曜は、Besiegeでいこう。</h2>
      <div class="cta-tags">
        <span class="ctag">#ゴールデンBesiegeタイム</span>
        <span class="ctag">#FridayBesiege</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="footer-copy">本イベントは EEX-slime による非公式ファンイベントです。</p>
      <p class="footer-copy" >『Besiege』および関連する権利は Spiderling Studios に帰属します。</p>
      <p class="footer-copy" >本ページの文章・構成など、本イベントのために作成されたオリジナル要素の権利は EEX-slime に帰属します。</p>
      <p class="footer-copy" >問題がある場合は、権利者の要請に従い速やかに対応します。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
.site-footer {
  position: relative;
  padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
  overflow: hidden;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(139,58,15,0.06));
}

.footer-accent {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--color-rust) 15%, var(--color-orange) 40%, var(--color-gold) 50%, var(--color-orange) 60%, var(--color-rust) 85%, transparent 100%);
}

.footer-cta {
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.cta-gears {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.fg {
  position: absolute;
  fill: rgba(139,58,15,0.1);
  animation: spin linear infinite;
}

.fg-l { width: 200px; height: 200px; bottom: -60px; left: -60px; animation-duration: 50s; }
.fg-r { width: 140px; height: 140px; top: -30px; right: -30px; animation-duration: 35s; animation-direction: reverse; }

@keyframes spin {
  from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  to   { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.cta-heading {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
  color: var(--color-gold);
  text-shadow:
    3px 3px 0 var(--color-rust),
    0 0 30px rgba(255,215,0,0.2);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  position: relative;
}

.cta-lines {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.5vw, 1.1rem);
  line-height: 2;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  position: relative;
}

.cta-main-line {
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.cta-tags {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  position: relative;
}

.ctag {
  font-family: var(--font-display-mixed);
  font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1rem);
  color: var(--color-bg);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-orange), var(--color-gold));
  padding: 0.35em 1.2em;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  clip-path: polygon(0.6rem 0%,calc(100% - 0.6rem) 0%,100% 50%,calc(100% - 0.6rem) 100%,0.6rem 100%,0% 50%);
}

.footer-bottom {
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone);
  padding-top: 2rem;
}

.footer-note {
  font-family: var(--font-display-mixed);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: var(--color-rust);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.footer-copy {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  opacity: 0.5;
}
</style>
